flowchart TD
  A[Consume passing WP-22 matrix] --> B[Inventory canonical docs claims and commands]
  B --> C[Classify current stale planned blocked historical unsupported]
  C --> D{Claim maps to accepted exact evidence?}
  D -- No --> E[Remove narrow or mark non-claim]
  D -- Yes --> F[Update canonical release truth]
  E --> G[Build docs review and ADR candidate packets]
  F --> G
  G --> H[Validate links formats versions WP ownership and redaction]
  H --> I{Contradictions or unsupported claims remain?}
  I -- Yes --> J[Block with findings]
  I -- No --> K[Exact-head docs review]
